</p>
<p>
    <strong>Core Gameplan (The Attunement MVP):</strong>
    <a href="#" class="card-hover" data-card-name="Attunement"
        >Attunement</a
    > is unequivocally the most valuable player in this matchup. First,
    it systematically transforms stagnant land floods—often retained
    to guarantee land drops through discard—into live gas. Most importantly,
    <strong
        >Attunement functions as a defensive resource vault by
        allowing you to float critical pieces on top of your
        library, making them entirely immune to continuous hand
        discard and <a
            href="#"
            class="card-hover"
            data-card-name="Dystopia">Dystopia</a
        >.</strong
    > Even against an active <a
        href="#"
        class="card-hover"
        data-card-name="Withered Wretch">Withered Wretch</a
    >, maintaining an operational Attunement allows you to
    explosively load a fresh graveyard on the exact turn their
    graveyard interaction is neutralized.
</p>
<p>
    <strong
        >Sideboard Strategy (Seal Priority & Morph Evasion):</strong
